        "beat_ord": 2,
        "headline": "You whisper the truth to Elara",
        "body_excerpt": "You grip Elara's elbow and guide her behind a heavy velvet drape... \"Victor just told me the votes are managed,\" you whisper... Elara's breath catches. For a moment, she looks like a cornered doe. Then her jaw tightens. \"That bastard,\" she hisses...",
        "why_pivotal": "This is the moment you break the conspiracy to Elara, shifting her from unwitting puppet to potential ally against Victor."
      },
      {
        "beat_ord": 6,
        "headline": "You confront Victor about 'man",
        "body_excerpt": "\"Managed,\" you repeat, your voice low but carrying an edge that makes his smile falter... \"You said the votes are managed. What exactly does that mean, Victor?\" His recovery is almost seamless—a practiced chuckle... \"Your agency's biggest backer, remember? If Elara doesn't win, we all lose.\"",
        "why_pivotal": "You directly challenge Victor, forcing him to reveal his rationalization and exposing the pressure he holds over you as the agency's backer."
      },
      {
        "beat_ord": 8,
        "headline": "Elara reveals she's recorded V",
        "body_excerpt": "Elara, who has been silent, suddenly laughs—a brittle, unexpected sound. \"You think he's the only one with proof, Victor?\" She pulls out her phone, the screen glowing with a paused audio recording. \"I've been recording this entire conversation. Every word about managed votes, about your 'smart business.'\"",
        "why_pivotal": "Elara produces a secret recording, turning the tables on Victor and giving you both concrete leverage to counter his threats."
      },
