        "beat_ord": 16,
        "headline": "Victor breaks and signs a cont",
        "body_excerpt": "Victor's jaw works silently... Then, with a shudder that seems to travel the length of his body, he nods. \"Fine,\" he grates out. \"You win. The contracts are void. Just get me out of here.\" He pulls a pen from his jacket and scribbles on a napkin—a hastily scrawled release...",
